# UI Styles — CryptoSandboxQA

When creating or modifying UI elements (buttons, inputs, selects, tabs, cards), use these existing design tokens. Components must live inside `group-data-[theme=light]` parents for light/dark theme support.

## Buttons

### Secondary / outline (navigation, actions, cancel)
```
rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-0 outline-none focus:outline-none bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 hover:text-emerald-300 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-emerald-50 group-data-[theme=light]:text-emerald-700 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:bg-emerald-100 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:text-emerald-800
```

### Primary / submit (forms, main CTA)
```
w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 text-white font-medium hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/50 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-slate-900 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed
```

### Sort / filter (compact)
```
rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors border-0 outline-none focus:outline-none bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 hover:text-emerald-300 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-emerald-50 group-data-[theme=light]:text-emerald-700 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:bg-emerald-100 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:text-emerald-800
```
Active state: add `ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30`

---

## Inputs

### Text input (base)
```
w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[var(--input-bg)] border text-[var(--text)] placeholder-[var(--text-muted)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/50 focus:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors
```

### Input states
- Normal: `border-[var(--border)]`
- Error: `border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500/50 focus:border-red-500/50`

---

## Selects / dropdowns

```
rounded-lg border border-slate-600 bg-slate-800/80 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none group-data-[theme=light]:border-slate-300 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-white group-data-[theme=light]:text-slate-900
```

---

## Tabs (toggle group)

Base:
```
rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-0 outline-none focus:outline-none
```

Inactive:
```
bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 hover:text-emerald-300 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-emerald-50 group-data-[theme=light]:text-emerald-700 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:bg-emerald-100 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:text-emerald-800
```

Active:
```
bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-emerald-100 group-data-[theme=light]:text-emerald-800
```

---

## Cards / containers

```
rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/50 group-data-[theme=light]:border-slate-200 group-data-[theme=light]:bg-white/80
```

Inner sections (dividers): `border-slate-700/80 group-data-[theme=light]:border-slate-200`

---

## Status colors

- **Positive / success / buy:** `text-emerald-400` (light: `text-emerald-600`)
- **Negative / error / sell:** `text-red-400`
- **Warning / pending:** `text-amber-400`
- **Muted:** `text-slate-400` (light: `text-slate-600`)

---

## Links (text)

```
font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors group-data-[theme=light]:text-emerald-600 group-data-[theme=light]:hover:text-emerald-700
```

---

## Date inputs (History filters)

Same as selects; use `type="date"` with select styling classes.
